a5593d1eb8f946d9bf41da36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768881875","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Call of the Golden Valley touches on emotional themes such as missing people, mental health, and friendship."},"demos":[{"appid":2156020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Golden Valley is a thrilling true crime-like mystery game with an immersive narrative set in a charming but eerie Australian country town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Danielle, an American tourist travelling to an old town in the Australian countryside to visit her friend Marisa. Upon arrival, you discover that Marisa is not only nowhere to be found, but that she\u2019s actually one of the many people who have recently vanished without a trace from this seemingly harmless small country town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to save your friend, you must search the internet for clues, solve mysterious puzzles and uncover the conspiracy behind the vanishing hikers of Golden Valley.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.poster.avif?t=1768881875\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131660/extras/fa63fda0a9d55c1125fe49848c99b0c5.webm?t=1768881875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/